        "541c59e2c14e749cdbf4": "I want to browse your goods.",
        "a2fb80f72bbedc1ec8cb": "Aha!  Good day, good day, Master $C!  Come, sit down and have a drink.  You have an enterprising look in your eye, and I think you'll find speaking to me worth your time..."
      },
